{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50716","headline":"酬张权宣州新桥秋夜对月见寄 · 张祜","name":"酬张权宣州新桥秋夜对月见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢亭烟月泛清流，千载溪山一造舟。\n风定远帆依郡郭，夜深寒笛起江楼。\n张凭逆旅逢新唱，王粲从军值胜游。\n长爱征南杜公意，不将余力碍《春秋》。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}